### Google Health API – manual requests
### Works with the VS Code extension "REST Client" (humao.rest-client) or IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Get a token: run `node explore.mjs` once, or use the "refresh" request below and copy access_token.

@baseUrl = https://health.googleapis.com/v4/users/me
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Refresh the access token (fill in your values, do not commit them!)
POST https://oauth2.googleapis.com/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=YOUR_CLIENT_ID&client_secret=YOUR_CLIENT_SECRET&refresh_token=YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN&grant_type=refresh_token

### Identity – is the account linked?
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Paired devices
GET {{baseUrl}}/pairedDevices
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Steps per day
POST {{baseUrl}}/dataTypes/steps/dataPoints:dailyRollUp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "range": {
    "start": { "date": { "year": 2026, "month": 10, "day": 1 }, "time": {} },
    "end":   { "date": { "year": 2026, "month": 10, "day": 7 }, "time": {} }
  },
  "windowSizeDays": 1
}

### Steps (raw, deduplicated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/dataTypes/steps/dataPoints:reconcile?filter=steps.interval.civil_start_time%20%3E%3D%20%222026-10-06T00:00:00%22
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Sleep sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/dataTypes/sleep/dataPoints:reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Exercises / activities
GET {{baseUrl}}/dataTypes/exercise/dataPoints:reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Active zone minutes per day
POST {{baseUrl}}/dataTypes/active-zone-minutes/dataPoints:dailyRollUp
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "range": {
    "start": { "date": { "year": 2026, "month": 10, "day": 1 }, "time": {} },
    "end":   { "date": { "year": 2026, "month": 10, "day": 7 }, "time": {} }
  },
  "windowSizeDays": 1
}

### Daily resting heart rate
GET {{baseUrl}}/dataTypes/daily-resting-heart-rate/dataPoints:reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
